  m_Name: CH02M01_Gridlock_opening
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game.Configs::Game.Configs.NarrativeSequenceConfig
  sequenceId: seq.ch02.open.broken_grid
  entryStateId: Gridlock-opening-0
  defaultSkipDestinationId: Gridlock-opening-complete
  states:
  - stateId: Gridlock-opening-0
    kind: 0
    panel16x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel20x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel16x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: 04673fd3ce8c5411fa4626ed3f876de9
      m_SubObjectName: CH02-O01-16x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    panel20x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: 04673fd3ce8c5411fa4626ed3f876de9
      m_SubObjectName: CH02-O01-20x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    lines:
    - lineId: gridlock-opening-01
      textKey: narrative.gridlock.opening.01
      englishFallback: The city survived the first attacks. But a quiet street is
        not a working city. Relief trucks are trapped behind blocked roads and dark
        intersections.
      speaker: 2
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d15c87d96d44942898078eb6d5cb4e6a, type: 3}
      femaleVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      neutralVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      startSeconds: 0
      deadlineSeconds: 14.6
      essentialCaption: 1
    continueStateId: Gridlock-opening-1
    skipStateId: Gridlock-opening-complete
    reducedMotionSupported: 1
    durationSeconds: 14.6
    motionPreset: 0
    locationTitleKey: 
    locationTitleFallback: 
    locationSubtitleKey: 
    locationSubtitleFallback: 
    musicCue: 0
    ambienceCue: 0
    vehicleCue: 0
    eventCue: 3
    routeRole: 0
    completionPayloadId: 
    evidenceIds: []
    missionContextFlags: []
  - stateId: Gridlock-opening-1
    kind: 0
    panel16x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel20x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel16x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: fa6fe936b7a6a410fa46cf8569228ae3
      m_SubObjectName: CH02-O02-16x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    panel20x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: fa6fe936b7a6a410fa46cf8569228ae3
      m_SubObjectName: CH02-O02-20x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    lines:
    - lineId: gridlock-opening-02
      textKey: narrative.gridlock.opening.02
      englishFallback: The clinic's generator is running low. Its Fuel is on the
        other side of a damaged corridor. Keeping the ward open starts with getting
        that road back.
      speaker: 1
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 45a85633f1651443785be2be6bd7abec, type: 3}
      femaleVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      neutralVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      startSeconds: 0
      deadlineSeconds: 11.72
      essentialCaption: 1
    continueStateId: Gridlock-opening-2
    skipStateId: Gridlock-opening-complete
    reducedMotionSupported: 1
    durationSeconds: 11.72
    motionPreset: 0
    locationTitleKey: 
    locationTitleFallback: 
    locationSubtitleKey: 
    locationSubtitleFallback: 
    musicCue: 0
    ambienceCue: 0
    vehicleCue: 0
    eventCue: 3
    routeRole: 0
    completionPayloadId: 
    evidenceIds: []
    missionContextFlags: []
  - stateId: Gridlock-opening-2
    kind: 0
    panel16x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel20x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel16x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: dfeaa3d9a35374a91a7e60be7f78ab93
      m_SubObjectName: CH02-O03-16x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    panel20x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: dfeaa3d9a35374a91a7e60be7f78ab93
      m_SubObjectName: CH02-O03-20x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    lines:
    - lineId: gridlock-opening-03
      textKey: narrative.gridlock.opening.03
      englishFallback: "Roads, Fuel, markets, power, shelters\u2014and the people
        who keep them working. Lose one link and the others begin to fail. We have
        to restore them together."
      speaker: 2
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 02714bfcc850f4cbaa5ec2e473c99a34, type: 3}
      femaleVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      neutralVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      startSeconds: 0
      deadlineSeconds: 15.16
      essentialCaption: 1
    continueStateId: Gridlock-opening-3
    skipStateId: Gridlock-opening-complete
    reducedMotionSupported: 1
    durationSeconds: 15.16
    motionPreset: 0
    locationTitleKey: 
    locationTitleFallback: 
    locationSubtitleKey: 
    locationSubtitleFallback: 
    musicCue: 0
    ambienceCue: 0
    vehicleCue: 0
    eventCue: 3
    routeRole: 0
    completionPayloadId: 
    evidenceIds: []
    missionContextFlags: []
  - stateId: Gridlock-opening-3
    kind: 0
    panel16x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel20x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel16x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: 8d85c2366747c4ab592fe5d4847fcbf1
      m_SubObjectName: CH02-O04-16x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    panel20x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: 8d85c2366747c4ab592fe5d4847fcbf1
      m_SubObjectName: CH02-O04-20x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    lines:
    - lineId: gridlock-opening-04
      textKey: narrative.gridlock.opening.04
      englishFallback: My map covers the formal road network. Fadi knows service
        lanes and local connections it does not show. We will need both kinds of
        knowledge.
      speaker: 3
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 49b831cd962c944bdb032ea9415a427f, type: 3}
      femaleVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      neutralVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      startSeconds: 0
      deadlineSeconds: 11.8
      essentialCaption: 1
    continueStateId: Gridlock-opening-4
    skipStateId: Gridlock-opening-complete
    reducedMotionSupported: 1
    durationSeconds: 11.8
    motionPreset: 0
    locationTitleKey: 
    locationTitleFallback: 
    locationSubtitleKey: 
    locationSubtitleFallback: 
    musicCue: 0
    ambienceCue: 0
    vehicleCue: 0
    eventCue: 3
    routeRole: 0
    completionPayloadId: 
    evidenceIds: []
    missionContextFlags: []
  - stateId: Gridlock-opening-4
    kind: 0
    panel16x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel20x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel16x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: 95537a9e0381c48d88ec90b2c191bad6
      m_SubObjectName: CH02-O05-16x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    panel20x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: 95537a9e0381c48d88ec90b2c191bad6
      m_SubObjectName: CH02-O05-20x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    lines:
    - lineId: gridlock-opening-05
      textKey: narrative.gridlock.opening.05
      englishFallback: "Commander, restore the lifelines. Protect the crews doing
        the work. And watch which roads the saboteurs leave open\u2014they may be
        choosing where we go next."
      speaker: 1
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 372a942fe935741acb40037c724e7ccf, type: 3}
      femaleVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      neutralVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      startSeconds: 0
      deadlineSeconds: 13.88
      essentialCaption: 1
    continueStateId: Gridlock-opening-complete
    skipStateId: Gridlock-opening-complete
